title: Change PPS Advisers
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: shuffle_leadership_timer = 0
on-arrival: month_activities += 1; shuffle_leadership_timer = 8;
card-image: img/workers.jpg
go-to: rm_main

The PPS may have no more than three active advisers. Dismissing an adviser increases dissent in their faction. An adviser's first appointment strengthens that faction; dismissing and reappointing the same person cannot repeatedly generate strength.

- @rm_main: Remove advisers
- @advisor_menu: Appoint advisers
- @remove_none: Do not change the adviser team
- @easy_discard

@rm_main
title: Remove advisers

- @remove_daszynski
- @remove_puzak
- @remove_perl
- @remove_niedzialkowski
- @remove_arciszewski
- @remove_zaremba
- @remove_czapinski
- @remove_prochnik
- @remove_dubois
- @remove_drobner
- @remove_jaworowski
- @remove_moraczewski
- @remove_ziemiecki
- @remove_malinowski
- @advisor_menu: Appoint advisers
- @remove_none: Finish changing advisers

@remove_none
title: Finish changing advisers
go-to: root

@remove_daszynski
title: Remove Ignacy Daszyński
view-if: daszynski_advisor = 1
on-arrival: daszynski_advisor = 0; centrum_dissent += 5; n_advisors -= 1
go-to: rm_main

Daszyński has been removed as an adviser. Centrum PPS disapproves.

