@add_daszynski
title: Ignacy Daszyński — Centrum PPS
view-if: daszynski_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3 and daszynski_left_adviser_pool = 0 and year < 1931
on-arrival: centrum_strength += 5 if not daszynski_appointed_once; daszynski_appointed_once = 1; daszynski_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu

Daszyński has joined the active adviser team.

@add_puzak
title: Kazimierz Pużak — Centrum PPS
view-if: puzak_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3 and puzak_left_adviser_pool = 0
on-arrival: centrum_strength += 5 if not puzak_appointed_once; puzak_appointed_once = 1; puzak_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
