Pużak has joined the active adviser team.

@add_perl
title: Feliks Perl — Centrum PPS
view-if: perl_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3 and perl_left_adviser_pool = 0 and (year < 1927 or (year = 1927 and month < 4))
on-arrival: centrum_strength += 5 if not perl_appointed_once; perl_appointed_once = 1; perl_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu

Perl has joined the active adviser team.

